  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "2. Grease a 20cm (8 inch) square baking dish with olive oil.",
    "3. In a large bowl, mix together the Portuguese meal, bake, salt, and black pepper.",
    "4. Press the mixture into the prepared baking dish.",
    "5. Bake for 20-25 minutes or until lightly golden.",
    "6. Remove from the oven and let cool for 10 minutes.",
    "7. Top with aerated and serve warm.",
    "8. Slice into squares and serve."
